        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I can help if we have enough.  I glanced at the shaman epic walk through and Lord Ghiosk is just a straight kill, but you need a rogue to get through the locked door.  I believe he is through the first locked door that we couldn't open on our last visit.  </P><P>The mob with the big fire AE (-2000 HP AE) is the final fight - Rak'Ashiir.  The guide said you use level 49 fire pets which are immune to the AE and just heal them.  </P><P>There are a few more steps before the final fight:  visit the Hole and kill Kirn, then Neh'Ashiir in City of Mist, and finally Dread, Fright, or Terror in Fear to spawn Iksar Broodling.  Neh'Ashiir and Rak'Ashiir spawn when you kill black reavers; sometimes they are left up as they spawn non-KOS.  </P><P>Milaru, 56 Mage<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
